1
00:00:44,670 --> 00:00:45,420
[Unsoiled Starlight]

2
00:00:45,450 --> 00:00:46,740
[Episode 13]

3
00:00:46,780 --> 00:00:47,390
[Adapted from Migu's novel
“Unsoiled Starlight” ]

4
00:00:47,410 --> 00:00:47,960
[Original Writer: Shan Gu Jun]

5
00:01:08,410 --> 00:01:09,280
Shu Tinglan.

6
00:01:15,200 --> 00:01:16,360
Can we grab dinner

7
00:01:16,360 --> 00:01:16,890
and talk?

8
00:01:16,910 --> 00:01:17,760
No, we can't.

9
00:01:20,960 --> 00:01:21,720
Shu Tinglan.

10
00:01:22,280 --> 00:01:23,160
You refuse to communicate with me.

11
00:01:23,160 --> 00:01:24,820
Where exactly do you place me?

12
00:01:27,160 --> 00:01:28,560
The position of a client.

13
00:01:28,640 --> 00:01:30,100
It's after work hours now.

14
00:02:16,920 --> 00:02:17,650
You're back.

15
00:02:18,160 --> 00:02:18,920
Time to eat.

16
00:02:24,640 --> 00:02:25,600
Shushu.

17
00:02:26,960 --> 00:02:27,640
Shushu.

18
00:02:28,120 --> 00:02:28,760
Shushu.

19
00:02:30,640 --> 00:02:32,440
I know you're in a bad mood today.

20
00:02:32,940 --> 00:02:35,040
So I specially ordered a big meal
to keep you company.

21
00:02:35,040 --> 00:02:35,700
How's that?

22
00:02:35,840 --> 00:02:36,970
Thoughtful, right?

23
00:02:37,270 --> 00:02:37,800
Yes.

24
00:02:37,920 --> 00:02:39,520
You're the most thoughtful.

25
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:51,200
So—

26
00:02:51,400 --> 00:02:53,640
You just apologized to Wen Jian like that?

27
00:02:53,640 --> 00:02:54,240
Mm.

28
00:02:54,240 --> 00:02:55,370
What else could I do?

29
00:02:56,020 --> 00:02:57,960
Face isn't as important as work.

30
00:02:58,640 --> 00:02:59,360
Besides,

31
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:01,720
I think Lawyer Xiao is right.

32
00:03:02,120 --> 00:03:03,240
Avoidance is useful,

33
00:03:03,240 --> 00:03:04,700
but you can't run forever.

34
00:03:04,960 --> 00:03:06,240
Only by facing the problem

35
00:03:06,240 --> 00:03:07,120
and solving it

36
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:08,000
can you grow.

37
00:03:09,400 --> 00:03:10,930
Then what about Zhuo Yu'an?

38
00:03:12,320 --> 00:03:13,400
If I were you,

39
00:03:13,560 --> 00:03:15,840
I'd steal him right from under Wen Jian.

40
00:03:17,720 --> 00:03:19,000
He's not an object.

41
00:03:19,320 --> 00:03:20,650
What do you mean, steal?

42
00:03:21,640 --> 00:03:22,640
Besides,

43
00:03:23,520 --> 00:03:24,760
Zhuo Yu'an and I

44
00:03:24,890 --> 00:03:26,560
haven't even established a relationship.

45
00:03:26,560 --> 00:03:27,720
Whoever he chooses

46
00:03:27,720 --> 00:03:28,850
is his own business.

47
00:03:31,640 --> 00:03:33,160
Well, well, Shu Tinglan.

48
00:03:33,590 --> 00:03:36,320
You’re totally desensitized
to Wen Jian now.

49
00:03:36,520 --> 00:03:38,120
And emotionally—

50
00:03:38,120 --> 00:03:39,780
you can pick it up and let it go.

51
00:03:40,840 --> 00:03:42,800
A role model for us.

52
00:03:43,200 --> 00:03:43,960
Not bad.

53
00:03:44,600 --> 00:03:47,400
I'll reward you with a big rib.

54
00:03:48,120 --> 00:03:48,920
Eat up.

55
00:03:49,040 --> 00:03:49,920
Mm.

56
00:03:58,840 --> 00:04:02,310
[Special Inspection Report on
Intellectual Property Risks]

57
00:03:59,520 --> 00:04:00,120
Mr. Zhuo.

58
00:04:00,550 --> 00:04:01,880
The current progress and issues

59
00:04:01,880 --> 00:04:02,640
are these.

60
00:04:12,160 --> 00:04:12,960
Anything involving

61
00:04:12,960 --> 00:04:14,720
designers with personal trademarks—

62
00:04:14,720 --> 00:04:16,839
copyright fees need to be paid separately.

63
00:04:16,839 --> 00:04:18,899
This wasn't reflected in the report.

64
00:04:19,360 --> 00:04:21,760
I'd like Lawyer Shu to give me
an explanation.

65
00:04:21,760 --> 00:04:23,760
Copyright disputes are a big issue.

66
00:04:23,840 --> 00:04:26,560
Zhuoyuan doesn't want to stumble
on something like this.

67
00:04:26,560 --> 00:04:27,360
Indeed.

68
00:04:27,720 --> 00:04:29,240
The version Lawyer Zhang just presented

69
00:04:29,240 --> 00:04:30,500
had certain problems.

70
00:04:33,760 --> 00:04:34,960
It was our oversight.

71
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:41,000
It's a very basic mistake.

72
00:04:41,440 --> 00:04:42,600
I can't help but question

73
00:04:42,600 --> 00:04:43,760
whether Lawyer Shu's report

74
00:04:43,760 --> 00:04:45,320
is professional

75
00:04:45,440 --> 00:04:46,520
or accurate.

76
00:05:00,320 --> 00:05:02,870
[Special Inspection Report on
Intellectual Property Risks]

77
00:05:02,980 --> 00:05:03,470
[Menu]

78
00:05:05,200 --> 00:05:06,560
What everyone is seeing now

79
00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:08,160
is the latest version in my hands.

80
00:05:08,160 --> 00:05:09,960
It's been repeatedly checked.

81
00:05:09,960 --> 00:05:12,400
All patent and copyright ownership
is very clear.

82
00:05:12,400 --> 00:05:13,840
There are no problems whatsoever.

83
00:05:13,840 --> 00:05:15,600
I take responsibility for
the report I issued.

84
00:05:15,600 --> 00:05:17,040
And I can say with certainty

85
00:05:17,040 --> 00:05:19,400
that in contracts with Zhuoyuan Tech
as the subject,

86
00:05:19,400 --> 00:05:21,260
there are no copyright disputes.

87
00:05:21,960 --> 00:05:23,490
Your guarantee is useless.

88
00:05:23,640 --> 00:05:25,990
I hope the lawyers cooperating
with Zhuoyuan Tech

89
00:05:25,990 --> 00:05:28,190
can always maintain professionalism.

90
00:05:33,040 --> 00:05:34,040
What do you think?

91
00:05:34,280 --> 00:05:35,000
Mr. Zhuo.

92
00:05:40,200 --> 00:05:41,460
It's not that serious.

93
00:05:43,540 --> 00:05:45,270
Just be more careful next time.

94
00:05:51,990 --> 00:05:53,120
[Scope and Methods of Verification]

95
00:05:55,320 --> 00:05:56,320
Anyway,

96
00:05:56,320 --> 00:05:59,640
this cooperation with Hongzheng Law Firm
has been quite pleasant.

97
00:05:59,640 --> 00:06:01,580
Now there's only the final
delivery stage left.

98
00:06:01,580 --> 00:06:03,710
I'll rely on your continuous support.

99
00:06:07,100 --> 00:06:08,640
These past days, colleagues

100
00:06:08,640 --> 00:06:09,520
and partners—

101
00:06:09,520 --> 00:06:10,600
thank you for your hard work.

102
00:06:10,600 --> 00:06:12,040
To express our gratitude,

103
00:06:12,040 --> 00:06:13,040
Zhuoyuan Tech

104
00:06:13,040 --> 00:06:14,960
has provided internal benefits
for everyone:

105
00:06:14,960 --> 00:06:17,720
free whole-home installation of
Zhuoyuan Tech's new products

106
00:06:17,720 --> 00:06:19,580
and deployment of smart systems.

107
00:06:19,860 --> 00:06:23,460
Please give your residential addresses
to the tech department.

108
00:06:36,240 --> 00:06:37,360
By the way, Tinglan.

109
00:06:37,360 --> 00:06:38,600
How could there be a mistake

110
00:06:38,600 --> 00:06:40,760
in the company asset equity documents?

111
00:06:40,760 --> 00:06:41,680
Jiajia didn't give my

112
00:06:41,680 --> 00:06:43,210
final version to Zhuoyuan.

113
00:06:43,560 --> 00:06:44,560
I'm not sure

114
00:06:45,159 --> 00:06:46,420
if she did it on purpose

115
00:06:46,760 --> 00:06:47,620
or just forgot.

116
00:06:48,960 --> 00:06:50,840
Jiajia was careless about this.

117
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:52,409
You need to be more careful from now on.

118
00:06:52,409 --> 00:06:52,930
Okay.

119
00:07:14,240 --> 00:07:15,040
Mr. Zhuo.

120
00:07:20,440 --> 00:07:21,500
Morning, Mr. Zhuo.

121
00:07:23,440 --> 00:07:24,200
So early?

122
00:07:24,600 --> 00:07:25,480
Outside business.

123
00:07:25,480 --> 00:07:25,960
Yes.

124
00:07:25,960 --> 00:07:27,400
Tinglan and I are going to Shengpurui

125
00:07:27,400 --> 00:07:29,400
for the final handover verification.

126
00:07:29,400 --> 00:07:31,520
So early to discuss business?

127
00:07:34,560 --> 00:07:35,680
What a coincidence.

128
00:07:35,680 --> 00:07:37,280
I'm going to Shengpurui too.

129
00:07:38,400 --> 00:07:39,530
I'll drive you both.

130
00:07:40,640 --> 00:07:41,770
Thank you, Mr. Zhuo.

131
00:07:45,840 --> 00:07:46,640
Lawyer Shu.

132
00:07:46,880 --> 00:07:49,140
These are our company's core documents.

133
00:07:49,360 --> 00:07:50,400
Normally,

134
00:07:50,400 --> 00:07:52,000
they're absolutely not allowed
to leave the premises.

135
00:07:52,000 --> 00:07:54,240
But since Zhuoyuan Tech requested it,

136
00:07:54,320 --> 00:07:55,920
we'll trustfully

137
00:07:56,240 --> 00:07:57,440
hand them over to you.

138
00:07:58,120 --> 00:07:58,850
Understood.

139
00:07:58,880 --> 00:08:00,010
Thank you very much.

140
00:08:00,160 --> 00:08:01,760
We'll certainly keep them safe.

141
00:08:01,760 --> 00:08:03,840
We'll return them as soon
as we've verified them.

142
00:08:03,840 --> 00:08:04,640
Good.

143
00:08:06,600 --> 00:08:07,720
Then you two go ahead and check.

144
00:08:07,720 --> 00:08:08,400
Mm.

145
00:08:08,400 --> 00:08:09,460
We'll be going now.

146
00:08:09,800 --> 00:08:10,930
-See you.
-Let’s go.

147
00:08:49,360 --> 00:08:50,760
The car's here. Let's go.

148
00:08:59,700 --> 00:09:01,640
You sit in the front.

149
00:09:51,240 --> 00:09:53,360
The car's here. Let's go.

150
00:10:20,340 --> 00:10:21,740
What are you looking for?

151
00:10:22,440 --> 00:10:24,640
An important articles of association
document is missing.

152
00:10:24,640 --> 00:10:26,800
I'm guessing it's probably
near Shengpurui.

153
00:10:26,800 --> 00:10:28,400
I'm going back to look for it.

154
00:10:33,680 --> 00:10:34,600
Mr. Zhuo.

155
00:10:35,200 --> 00:10:36,840
This is my problem alone.

156
00:10:36,840 --> 00:10:38,600
It has nothing to do with
Hongzheng Law Firm.

157
00:10:38,600 --> 00:10:40,120
If you're going to blame someone,

158
00:10:40,120 --> 00:10:41,320
blame me.

159
00:10:42,580 --> 00:10:43,960
Did you hear what I said?

160
00:10:46,270 --> 00:10:47,160
Zhuo Yu'an.

161
00:10:47,160 --> 00:10:48,760
Are you even listening to me?

162
00:10:49,240 --> 00:10:50,720
This really is my problem alone.

163
00:10:50,720 --> 00:10:52,380
It has nothing to do with them.

164
00:10:53,160 --> 00:10:54,080
Zhuo Yu'an.

165
00:10:58,040 --> 00:10:59,100
What are you doing?

166
00:11:00,600 --> 00:11:01,600
In your eyes,

167
00:11:01,800 --> 00:11:03,520
is the company

168
00:11:03,850 --> 00:11:04,640
a place where I make arbitrary decisions

169
00:11:04,640 --> 00:11:06,040
without reason or sense?

170
00:11:07,770 --> 00:11:08,920
Stop looking.

171
00:11:24,440 --> 00:11:25,700
[Articles of Incorporation of Shengpurui]

172
00:11:27,240 --> 00:11:28,000
Found it.

173
00:11:28,970 --> 00:11:30,000
Great.

174
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:31,530
How did you know it was here?

175
00:11:33,000 --> 00:11:34,400
I can't give it to you yet.

176
00:11:34,840 --> 00:11:35,640
I need it.

177
00:11:37,820 --> 00:11:38,680
Mr. Zhuo.

178
00:11:38,680 --> 00:11:40,600
This really is my problem alone.

179
00:11:40,760 --> 00:11:43,220
It has nothing to do with
Hongzheng Law Firm.

180
00:11:44,320 --> 00:11:45,380
I really do need it.

181
00:11:46,040 --> 00:11:47,840
I understand Mr. Zhuo's intention.

182
00:11:47,840 --> 00:11:49,760
You plan to hold a public accountability.

183
00:11:49,760 --> 00:11:50,680
But Mr. Zhuo is someone

184
00:11:50,680 --> 00:11:52,810
who values work procedures, isn't he?

185
00:11:53,040 --> 00:11:53,840
This matter

186
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:57,060
is currently still an internal matter
for our law firm.

187
00:11:57,230 --> 00:11:58,160
Could you

188
00:11:58,600 --> 00:12:00,130
let us handle it ourselves?

189
00:12:23,040 --> 00:12:24,040
Thank you.

190
00:12:39,660 --> 00:12:41,450
[Zhuoyuan Technology]

191
00:12:41,530 --> 00:12:42,830
[Articles of Incorporation of Shengpurui]

192
00:12:45,400 --> 00:12:47,440
You'd better give me
a reasonable explanation

193
00:12:47,440 --> 00:12:48,840
before this blows up.
